{"3103630": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Skelly Screamer", "steam_appid": 3103630, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly Screamer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skelly Screamer, use your <strong>microphone to move</strong>! The <strong>louder you scream, the faster you move</strong>! Overcome a vertical obstacle course to reach your destination in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively... you can use your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scream Meter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.poster.avif?t=1780199279\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.webm?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.mp4?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>louder</strong> you scream, the<strong> faster</strong> Skelly runs. So<strong> keep your cool</strong>! <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is a rage game, but If you <strong>vocally express your rage</strong>, you might cause a <strong>devastating fall</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are<strong> Skelly</strong>. This morning you rose from the dead too late and missed your alarm clock! It's time you get up and <strong>begin your trek to work</strong>... <strong>IN SPACE</strong>! Better start climbing!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/ce4e03b15b8f4c58f7dd95052423a656.poster.avif?t=1780199279\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/ce4e03b15b8f4c58f7dd95052423a656.webm?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/ce4e03b15b8f4c58f7dd95052423a656.mp4?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skelly Screamer </strong>has an array of unique levels ranging from <strong>concrete jungles, to sci-fi star ships</strong>! <strong>Scream</strong> through each one of them to reach your workplace in <strong>space</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Obstacles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/2c14b6cbeaf6a0a0488a0b6fb63a0fa7.poster.avif?t=1780199279\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/2c14b6cbeaf6a0a0488a0b6fb63a0fa7.webm?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/2c14b6cbeaf6a0a0488a0b6fb63a0fa7.mp4?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Skelly Screamer </strong>includes an assortment of bizarre obstacles. <strong>Zombies</strong>, <strong>fiery barriers</strong>, <strong>inconvenient</strong> <strong>conveyer belts</strong>, and <strong>more</strong>!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Play Without A Microphone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though <strong>Skelly Screamer</strong> is <strong>meant</strong> to be played with a <strong>microphone</strong>, you may <strong>use standard keyboard controls</strong> in the alternative <strong>Keyboard Mode</strong><i>.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Money and Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/fa9b275d3f884a3293f9737202c1c8bb.poster.avif?t=1780199279\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/fa9b275d3f884a3293f9737202c1c8bb.webm?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/fa9b275d3f884a3293f9737202c1c8bb.mp4?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect <strong>money</strong> that can be used to buy <strong>upgrades</strong>! </p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Skelly Screamer</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Skelly Screamer, use your <strong>microphone to move</strong>! The <strong>louder you scream, the faster you move</strong>! Overcome a vertical obstacle course to reach your destination in space!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Alternatively... you can use your keyboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Scream Meter</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.poster.avif?t=1780199279\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.webm?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3103630/extras/70eb0a9be63835eb7034a46fc400f46d.mp4?t=1780199279\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>louder</strong> you scream, the<strong> 